	(text "IL3 = Vref + G x I (I + = L1 -> C_f), IL3R = its Vref: 100R + 1 nF each at the source (as PV-PWR).\nThe primary sits between L1 and the C_f node (a 50 Hz-smooth node, not the switch node)."
